  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/DSC_0043.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px\" /></p>\n<p>El ondense Juan Garc&iacute;a Garrido participa este fin de semana, del 23 al 26 de enero, en el Campeonato Europeo de brazilian jiu jitsu, que se celebra en Lisboa y para el que se ha estado preparando intensamente en el gimnasio Kubotan.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0027.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0028.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0029.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0034.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0036.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0037.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0038.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0040.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0040\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/preparacionjuangarciagarridoeuropeobjj/dsc_0042.jpg